b20(6,3.5); b20(6,-3.5); b20(-6,3.5); b20(-6,-3.5); b20(8.5,2); b20(-8.5,2); b20(8.5,-2); b20(-8.5,-2);

b15(6,2); b15(6,-2); b15(-6,2); b15(-6,-2);[/asy]The answer is in the form  rac{m}{n}, where gcd(m, n) = 1. Please provide the value of m + n.

